Plan update
I ran two narrow PAIR lifecycle experiments, validated them with focused tests and sequential public/raw benches, reverted both because they were not keep-worthy, and updated the guide/log/hot-path docs to record them as rejected candidates. The code is back at the prior baseline; only the execution docs changed this turn.
  ✓ Implement narrow no-sync public send admission fast path for PAIR send scope and add runtime tests
  ✓ Build and run focused core/tests validation for socket runtime and send contract coverage
  ✓ Run targeted PAIR/DEALER_DEALER public+raw single benches and decide keep/revert
  ✓ Update guide/review/hot-path docs to match current code and latest measurements
